      "representative_excerpt": "ATF-2026-0011 | FR Doc 2026-08925 Position: Oppose \u2014 ATF should not add a new regulatory definition I oppose this rule. ATF should not add a new regulatory definition of \"business premises\" to 27 CFR part 478. The Gun Control Act uses the term in its ordinary commercial sense, and there is no statutory ambiguity that requires ATF intervention. Adding...",
