      "representative_length": 1835,
      "representative_excerpt": "Four of the buildings are contiguous to each other, but technically have separate street addresses. The entire campus is within a single fence. Our 5th building has an unaffiliated business separating it from our main campus. Currently we have 3 separate FFLs, and an offsite storage variance in order to conduct our single firearm manufacturing operation....",
