      "representative_length": 252,
      "representative_excerpt": "\u201cbusiness premises\u201d should be limited to the specific address of the property and not include the definition \" that adjoin each other; or that are adjacent to each other and adjoin the same parking lot, sidewalk, or road.\" that definition is too broad.",
